#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:38
msgid "Does FoA Cleaner require any third-party plugins?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:39
msgid "No. Every template, pattern, dark-mode control, and editorial feature works completely standalone on WordPress 6.6+. Optional Vibetiles integration activates automatically if you install the plugin."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:44
msgid "Are the bundled fonts self-hosted and GDPR friendly?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:45
msgid "Yes. Geist, DM Sans, and Geist Mono are served directly from the theme folder as SIL OFL 1.1 variable .woff2 files with zero external CDN requests."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:50
msgid "Can I turn off scroll-reveal animations?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:51
msgid "Yes. Toggle micro-animations off anytime under Appearance → FoA Cleaner, or via the foa_cleaner_enable_motion PHP filter. Visitors with OS reduced-motion enabled always get static rendering automatically."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:56
msgid "What happens to my content if I switch themes later?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:57
msgid "Every pattern uses standard WordPress core blocks with zero custom theme-locked blocks or shortcodes, so your pages remain intact wherever you move."
msgstr ""

